prayer-narsie-1 = Through blood and shadow...
prayer-narsie-2 = We offer this sacrifice...
prayer-narsie-3 = May her darkness embrace...
prayer-narsie-4 = In purity of blood...
prayer-narsie-5 = Praise the Geometer of Blood!
prayer-narsie-6 = Mah'weyh pleggh at e'ntrath!
prayer-narsie-7 = H'drak v'loso, mir'kanas verbot!
prayer-narsie-8 = N'ath reth sh'yro eth d'rekkathnor!
prayer-narsie-9 = Dedo ol'btoh!
prayer-narsie-10 = Gal'h'rfikk harfrandid mud'gib!
